  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The recipe to reverse fuse Moonlight Gu is normally kept by the clan leader, with one other most loyal clan elder of that generation also knowing the secret.",
      "chapters": [
        157
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_moonlight_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit claims countless recipes in his store, including thousands of Immortal Gu recipes. Fang Yuan at that time knows only about a dozen Immortal Gu recipes, most of them remnant, with only two intact and correct ones he will not freely expose.",
      "chapters": [
        463
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Refinement path has long been closely connected to wisdom path. To comprehend the world and deduce Gu refinement recipes, Gu Masters use many wisdom path methods. Refinement masters and grandmasters often seek wisdom path help when a recipe bottlenecks.",
      "chapters": [
        490
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deducing-recipes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_refinement",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_refinement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the same Gu recipe is sold multiple times in treasure yellow heaven and more Gu Immortals obtain it, its treasure light decreases, so repeated sales are a poor long-term income source.",
      "chapters": [
        508
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-value",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the light of wisdom, Fang Yuan spends large amounts of will to push an Immortal Gu remnant recipe toward completion, and even a strong will intake may move that deduction only a small fraction.",
      "chapters": [
        655
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "will-cost-of-deduction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Gu as products of those recipes are covered on Immortal Gu. Refinement failure as risk is covered on Refinement Failure.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
